<title>USA: La-Man Corp Q3 March 31 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>La-Man Corp Q3 March 31 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>LA-MAN CORPORATION</p>
<p>	     9 months ended March 31:  3 months ended March 31:</p>
<p>			  1997	 1996	  1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues     $11,626,000 $8,965,000  $3,803,000   $2,814,000</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>			974,000    412,000     255,000	   (89)</p>
<p> Per share		.30	  .15	   .08	  (.03)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>shares</p>
<p>  outstanding   3,266,000  2,760,000   3,296,000    2,944,000</p>
<p>NOTES:  All figures are for continuing operations.  During the six months ended December 31, 1996, the Company recognized and wrote down $650,000 equal to $.20 per share, related to discontinued operations.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
